}","js":"/*
 * UiChemy interactive runtime — ships in a uichemy_composer widget's raw_js.
 *
 * Why: React event handlers/state do NOT survive the static export. The
 * browser-settle already bakes correct *initial* values (counters, etc.), but
 * ongoing behavior (accordions, tabs, carousels) is gone. This tiny vanilla
 * runtime restores it for sections that mark their structure with data-uich-*
 * hooks. It is idempotent and a complete no-op when no hooks are present, so it
 * is safe to include on every interactive section.
 *
 * Conventions (the JSX should emit these for behavior to auto-wire):
 *   Accordion:  [data-uich-accordion(="multi")]
 *                 [data-uich-acc-item] > [data-uich-acc-trigger] + [data-uich-acc-panel]
 *   Tabs:       [data-uich-tabs]
 *                 [data-uich-tab][data-uich-target="X"] ... [data-uich-panel="X"]
 *   Carousel:   [data-uich-carousel(="autoplay-ms")]
 *                 [data-uich-track] (children = slides); optional
 *                 [data-uich-prev] / [data-uich-next] / [data-uich-dot][data-uich-index]
 *   Toggle:     [data-uich-toggle] (role=switch-ish); flips data-checked
 *   Gallery:    [data-uich-gallery]
 *                 [data-uich-gallery-main] (the big img)
 *                 [data-uich-gallery-thumb] (each thumb; optional
 *                   data-uich-gallery-full for a larger source)
 *   Stars:      [data-uich-stars] containing an element with
 *                 [data-uich-stars-pct="0-100"] whose width it sets
 *   Quantity:   [data-uich-qty]
 *                 [data-uich-qty-dec] + [data-uich-qty-input] + [data-uich-qty-inc]
 *   Woo cart:   [data-uich-woo-cart] (one per section; holds an empty
 *                 `div.widget_shopping_cart_content` for Woo to replace)
 *                 [data-uich-woo-cart-item] (each product card)
 *                 [data-uich-woo-remove] (that card's remove control)
 *                 [data-uich-woo-view-cart] (a link to the cart page)
