    /* The cart page, from the only source that is always right.
     *
     * The template ships `/my-cart/` so the link works with no JS, but a slug
     * is a guess: WooCommerce's Cart page is an ASSIGNMENT, and a re-import
     * moves it (see the build spec's re-import checklist). Woo prints
     * `wc_add_to_cart_params` inline on every Woo page carrying the assigned
     * page's real permalink — the value its own "View cart" notice uses — so
     * that is written over the authored fallback. Left alone when the global is
     * absent, i.e. any page without WooCommerce, where the fallback is still
     * the best answer available. */
